/Title (Comparison\040of\040perceived\040value\040structural\040models)
/Author (þÿ\000S\000u\000n\001\015\000a\000n\000a\000\040\000P\000i\000r\000i\000\040\000R\000a\000j\000h)
/Subject (Perceived\040value\040has\040been\040considered\040an\040important\040determinant\040of\040consumer\040shopping\040behavior\040and\040studied\040as\040such\040for\040a\040long\040period\040of\040time\056\040According\040to\040one\040research\040stream\054\040perceived\040value\040is\040a\040variable\040determined\040by\040perceived\040quality\040and\040perceived\040sacrifice\056\040Another\040research\040stream\040suggests\040that\040the\040perception\040of\040value\040is\040a\040result\040of\040the\040consumer\040risk\040perception\056\040This\040implies\040the\040presence\040of\040two\040somewhat\040independent\040research\040streams\040that\040are\040integrated\040by\040a\040third\040research\040stream\040\205\040the\040one\040suggesting\040that\040perceived\040value\040is\040a\040result\040of\040perceived\040quality\040and\040perceived\040sacrifices\040while\040perceived\040\050performance\040and\040financial\051\040risk\040mediates\040the\040relationship\040between\040perceived\040quality\040and\040perceived\040sacrifices\040on\040the\040one\040hand\054\040and\040perceived\040value\040on\040the\040other\056\040This\040paper\040describes\040the\040three\040approaches\040\050models\051\040that\040have\040been\040mentioned\056\040The\040aim\040of\040the\040paper\040is\040to\040determine\040which\040of\040the\040observed\040models\040show\040the\040most\040acceptable\040level\040of\040fit\040to\040the\040empirical\040data\056\040Using\040the\040survey\040method\054\040research\040involving\040three\040product\040categories\040has\040been\040conducted\040on\040a\040sample\040of\040Croatian\040consumers\056\040Collected\040data\040was\040analyzed\040by\040the\040structural\040equation\040modeling\040\050SEM\051\040method\056\040Research\040has\040shown\040an\040appropriate\040level\040of\040fit\040of\040each\040observed\040model\040to\040the\040empirical\040data\056\040However\054\040the\040model\040measuring\040the\040effect\040of\040perceived\040risk\040on\040perceived\040value\040indicates\040the\040best\040level\040of\040fit\054\040which\040implies\040that\040perceived\040performance\040risk\040and\040perceived\040financial\040risk\040are\040the\040best\040predictors\040of\040perceived\040value\056)
